# bay-slice-play.pdl - from ANY editor state to "Play pressed" with the Bay slice popup on screen. UNTESTED LIVE when generated (game_new_op cannot drive a window): run it once, fix the ids, then delete this line.
# Run: RELAY_DRIVE_NO_ESC=1 relay_drive <editor window pid> run @.apps/bay-slice/tests/bay-slice-play.pdl <x window id>
# The editor must have this book open (Books dropdown: it appears after the editor board is relaunched).
STEP | in | off
STEP | ensure | pm-play | tb-player
STEP | tapid | pm-play
STEP | sleep | 3000
STEP | expect | @.apps/rpg-edit-hq/state/game_ui.txt | contains | Bay slice | 15
STEP | see | label:Bay slice
